                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and he spoke to him again when Josiah's son Jehoiakim was king. After that, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " spoke to him many times, until the eleventh year of the reign of Zedekiah son of Josiah. In the fifth month of that year the people of Jerusalem were taken into exile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.3"
            ]
          }
        }
