            "verseId": "JER.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to me, “Do not say that you are too young, but go to the people I send you to, and tell them everything I command you to say. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Do not be afraid of them, for I will be with you to protect you. I, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", have spoken!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.8"
            ]
          }
        }
